This code doesn't include any mechanism to flush and clear the list periodically. This would require additional logic to manage memory usage, which is beyond the scope of this example. 

Finally, this code assumes that all accesses are from multiple threads. If you only have a single thread accessing your data structure, you could remove all locking mechanisms.
